      "source": [
        "The model comparison shows that the multiple linear regression model performed much better than the simple linear regression model. The simple model had an R² score of 0.2977, meaning it explained about 29.8% of the variation in total passengers. Its RMSE was about 46,280 passengers and its MAE was about 36,607 passengers.\n",
