        "The RMSE and MAE improved by almost 100%, showing a major reduction in prediction error. However, this result should be interpreted carefully because the multiple regression model used Dom_Pax and Int_Pax, and Pax is calculated from those two variables. This creates data leakage, because the model is being given direct components of the target variable.\n"
